WEBVTT
Language: en-GB

00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:10.520
<v Tara>Odile, which Wi-Fi is yours?
There seem to be two of you.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:14.336
<v Odile>Mine is the slow one. The
password is up on the board.

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:17.118
<v Tara>The other one is called Free and Fast.

00:00:17.118 --> 00:00:17.906
<v Tara>No password.

00:00:17.906 --> 00:00:19.743
<v Tara>It only wants my work email.

00:00:19.743 --> 00:00:20.596
<v Tara>And my login.

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:24.253
<v Odile>Then somebody in here is
fishing. And not for coffee.

00:00:24.542 --> 00:00:28.194
<v Tara>Slow it is. And tomorrow morning,
Bashir hears all about it.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.721
<v Odile>Slow, with cake. The best security I sell.

00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:44.996
<v Tara>Morning, Bashir. I nearly gave
my password to a coffee shop.

00:00:45.292 --> 00:00:48.470
<v Bashir>Nearly is my favourite
word. What stopped you?

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.915
<v Tara>It asked for my work login. Wi-Fi
does not need to know where I work.

00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:57.450
<v Bashir>Exactly. A network that asks
who you are is a person, asking.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.560
<v Bashir>Report it, so I can warn everyone else.

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:03.969
<v Tara>Already did. From my phone.
On the slow Wi-Fi.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.463
<v Bashir>Then the coffee is on me.
